426
00:20:23.513 --> 00:20:24.514
{\an8}AFASIA, GANGGUAN KECEMASAN

427
00:20:24.598 --> 00:20:26.433
{\an8}NAMA: JALANKAN KESESUAIAN
DIAGNOSIS : GANGGUAN KECEMASAN

