547
00:26:12.946 --> 00:26:13.905
Etanol,

548
00:26:13.989 --> 00:26:15.407
hidrogen peroksida,

549
00:26:16.366 --> 00:26:17.576
formalin.

550
00:26:21.329 --> 00:26:23.123
Formalin? Saya pernah mendengarnya sebelumnya.

551
00:26:24.541 --> 00:26:26.293
{\an8}DOMPET KIM HANDSOME DITEMUKAN

552
00:26:27.085 --> 00:26:28.128
JANG JE-IN, KIM TAMPAN

553
00:26:28.211 --> 00:26:29.379
Ya ampun, romantis sekali.

554
