Ada foto.

555
00:26:31.923 --> 00:26:33.174
Apa ini?

556
00:26:34.301 --> 00:26:35.594
Ada sesuatu di sini.

557
00:26:35.677 --> 00:26:37.971
SELFIE YANG MISTERIUS?

